{
  "page_id": "EM-25",
  "section_header": "ENGINE MECHANICAL — Cylinder Head",
  "title": "INSPECT VALVE STEM GUIDE WEAR / REPLACE VALVE GUIDE",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "9. INSPECT VALVE STEM GUIDE WEAR"
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 1,
      "description": "Measuring valve guide inside diameter using a dial indicator or telescoping gauge, with top-down view of valve guide shown in circular inset",
      "labels": [
        "Dial indicator/telescoping gauge",
        "Valve guide"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 4,
        "left": 4,
        "width": 38,
        "height": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(a) Using a dial indicator or telescoping gauge, measure the inside diameter of the valve guide."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "caption": "Standard inside diameter:",
      "headers": [
        "Measurement",
        "mm",
        "in."
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "",
          "8.01 — 8.03 mm",
          "(0.3154 — 0.3161 in.)"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 2,
      "description": "Measuring valve stem diameter using a micrometer, with side view of valve shown",
      "labels": [
        "Micrometer",
        "Valve stem"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 23,
        "left": 4,
        "width": 38,
        "height": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(b) Using a micrometer, measure the diameter of the valve stem."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "caption": "Standard valve stem diameter:",
      "headers": [
        "Type",
        "mm",
        "in."
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Intake",
          "7.970 — 7.985 mm",
          "(0.3138 — 0.3144 in.)"
        ],
        [
          "Exhaust",
          "7.965 — 7.980 mm",
          "(0.3136 — 0.3142 in.)"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(c) Subtract the valve stem measurement from the valve guide measurement."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "caption": "Standard oil clearance:",
      "headers": [
        "Type",
        "mm",
        "in."
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Intake",
          "0.025 — 0.060 mm",
          "(0.0010 — 0.0024 in.)"
        ],
        [
          "Exhaust",
          "0.030 — 0.065 mm",
          "(0.0012 — 0.0026 in.)"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "caption": "Maximum oil clearance:",
      "headers": [
        "Type",
        "mm",
        "in."
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Intake",
          "0.08 mm (0.0031 in.)",
          ""
        ],
        [
          "Exhaust",
          "0.10 mm (0.0039 in.)",
          ""
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "If the clearance is greater than following values, replace the valve and guide."
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 3,
      "description": "Hand checking valve stem clearance in guide with circular detail view showing measurement point",
      "labels": [],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 42,
        "left": 4,
        "width": 38,
        "height": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "10. IF NECESSARY, REPLACE VALVE GUIDE"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(a) Brake the valve guide using a brass bar and hammer.",
        "(b) Heat the cylinder head to approx. 90°C (194°F)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 4,
      "description": "Cylinder head being heated in an oven to 90 degrees Celsius",
      "labels": [
        "90°C"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 61,
        "left": 4,
        "width": 38,
        "height": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 5,
      "description": "Using SST tool and hammer to drive out valve guide from cylinder head",
      "labels": [
        "SST",
        "SST 09201-60011"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 80,
        "left": 4,
        "width": 38,
        "height": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(c) Using SST and a hammer, drive out the valve guide."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "part_number",
      "label": "SST",
      "number": "09201-60011",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
}
